PROPRIETARY — NOT OPEN SOURCE

This repository contains two categories of material with different owners. The
boundary between them is defined in docs/licensing.md, and the reasoning behind
it is recorded in the Chatter planning repository at
decisions/2026-09-05-portal-ip-ownership.md.

1. CORE

   The generic nonprofit-operations platform: the database schema, migrations,
   row-level security and permission model, application source code, and user
   interface components implementing events, inventory, people and roles,
   donations, volunteers, sponsors, programs, finance, governance,
   communications, and impact reporting.

   Copyright (c) 2026 Rickie Cruz McDougal. All rights reserved.

   No license is granted to any person or entity except as set out below. You
   may not use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell
   any part of the Core without prior written permission from the copyright
   holder.

2. ORGANIZATION MATERIAL

   Everything specific to Chatter Snow: the "Chatter Snow" name, wordmark,
   logo, and brand identity; all public-facing copy, program and Learn content,
   photography, and media; the bylaws, policies, and governance documents; the
   Chatter-specific configuration and seed data; and all operational data,
   including every record concerning an identifiable person.

   Owned by Chatter Snow, Inc. upon its incorporation. No license to
   Organization Material is granted by this file. The "Chatter Snow" name and
   marks may not be used to identify, endorse, or promote any product or
   service.

LICENSE TO CHATTER SNOW, INC.

Chatter Snow, Inc. is granted a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide,
royalty-free, non-exclusive license to use, host, modify, and create derivative
works of the Core for its own charitable operations, including the right to
fork and continue the Core independently. That license is set out in full in a
separate signed instrument and survives any change in the copyright holder's
relationship with the organization. Chatter Snow, Inc. owes nothing for it.

As of the date of this file, Chatter Snow, Inc. has not yet been incorporated
and that instrument has not been executed. Until it is, this file records the
intent, not a completed grant.

